1. Nf3 Nf6 {[Gligoric turned up 20 minutes late because "his watch was quite
bad" (BCM)]} 2. g3 g6 3. Bg2 Bg7 4. c4 O-O 5. d4 d6 6. O-O c5 7. Nc3 Nc6 8.
dxc5 dxc5 9. Bf4 Nd4 10. e3 Nxf3+ 11. Bxf3 Nd7 12. Ne4 Qb6 13. Qa4 $2 Ne5 $2 ({
"Gligoric seems to have developed needless fears when Larsen allowed a piece
to be trapped. He did not close the trap!} 13... e5 $1 {could be played. If}
14. Bg5 f6 15. Rad1 Qc7 {threatening Nb6." (CHESS)}) 14. Bxe5 Bxe5 15. Rfd1 Bf5
16. Rd2 Rad8 17. Rad1 Rxd2 18. Rxd2 Bxb2 19. Nxc5 Bc3 20. Nd7 Qc7 21. Nxf8 Bxd2
